        "TileImage": "$($repository 64c391f7-4765-48b6-96bc-df8aa5a4186b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\n\nOur clients have requested the elimination of two individuals operating behind the scenes of the Sanguine fashion event.\n\nMarcel DiMarco and Sebastian Sato must be removed while maintaining the appearance of tragic accidents. Intelligence indicates that both targets can be approached through their respective professional circles, making disguise selection a critical component of the operation.\n\nMove quickly, stay focused, and turn the runway into an inferno.\n\nGood luck, 47.",
